WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.610
In 2024, 59.7 per cent of births in France

2
00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:06.560
were to unmarried parents.

3
00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:08.200
Six in ten.

4
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.040
A French couple can choose «le mariage»,

5
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.400
«le PACS» or «l'union libre».

6
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.380
Three ways to be a couple.

7
00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:19.900
And in 2025, for the first time
since the Second World War,

8
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.550
France had more deaths than births.

9
00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:24.760
So is the family in crisis,

10
00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:26.960
or simply changing shape?

11
00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.840
What has really happened?

12
00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:32.210
In this mission, you'll follow
the laws that changed the family,

13
00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.530
from 1975 onwards.

14
00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:38.760
Then you'll read where children
under 18 actually live today.

15
00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:42.600
Your mission: find out what has
happened to the family in France,

16
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.120
and back it with evidence.
